a.sa.Chi.26/208\n</td>\n<td>As an ingredient of Khadiradi gutika.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>86\n</td>\n<td>Cha.sa.Chi.26/216\n</td>\n<td>Used in Arochaka for  Kavala.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>87\n</td>\n<td>Cha.sa.Chi.26/234\n</td>\n<td>Used in Pittaja netraroga.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>88\n</td>\n<td>Cha.sa.Chi.26/276\n</td>\n<td>As an ingredient of  Prapoundrakadi taila.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>89\n</td>\n<td>Cha.Sa.Chi.27/30\n</td>\n<td>As an ingredient  of Urustambha nashak Yoga\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>90\n</td>\n<td>Cha.Sa.Chi.28/150\n</td>\n<td>As an ingredient of Bala taila.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>91\n</td>\n<td>Cha.Sa.Chi.28/158\n</td>\n<td>As an ingredient of Amrutadi taila.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>92\n</td>\n<td>Cha.Sa.chi.29/128\n</td>\n<td>It is used in Sparshakarma for daha.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>93\n</td>\n<td>Cha.Sa.chi.29/134\n</td>\n<td>As an ingredient of Prapoundrakadi lepa in pitta  pradhana vatarakta for vedana, daaha, visarpa, raga &amp; sotha.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>94\n</td>\n<td>Cha.Sa.Chi.30/275\n</td>\n<td>Used in the treatment of Dorgandhya Stanya dosha, As  an ingredient of Sarivadi lepa.\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ayurvedic_pharmacological_properties\">Ayurvedic pharmacological properties</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>Properties\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Sr.no.</th>\n<th>Pharmacological criteria</th>\n<th>Properties\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Taste (<a href=\"/index.php?title=Rasa\" title=\"Rasa\">rasa</a>)</td>\n<td>Bitter (tikta), Sweet (madhura)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Potency (<a href=\"/index.php?title=Veerya\" title=\"Veerya\">veerya</a>)</td>\n<td>Cold (sheeta)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Post digestion effect (<a href=\"/index.php?title=Vipaka\" title=\"Vipaka\">vipaka</a>)</td>\n<td>Pungent (katu)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Qualities (<a href=\"/index.php?title=Guna\" title=\"Guna\">guna</a>)</td>\n<td>Light (laghu), Rough (ruksha)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Actions (<a href=\"/index.php?title=Karma\" title=\"Karma\">karma</a>)</td>\n<td>Pacify Kapha and Pitta\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Current_availability\">Current availability</span></h2>\n<p>Available \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Current_researches\">Current researches</span></h2>\n<pre>This article is under development ..\n</pre>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20250917211752\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.099 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.304 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 62/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1020/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.190/7 seconds\nLua virtual size: 19.39 MB/200 MB\nLua estimated memory usage: 0 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  280.933      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%  280.933      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key carakas1_carakasa:pcache:idhash:3787-0!canonical and timestamp 20250917211752 and revision id 43575\n -->\n</div></div><div class=\"printfooter\">Retrieved from \"<a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://www.carakasamhitaonline.com/mediawiki-1.32.1/index.php?title=Chandana&amp;oldid=43575\">https://www.carakasamhitaonline.com/mediawiki-1.32.1/index.php?title=Chandana&amp;oldid=43575</a>\"</div>\n\t\t<div id=\"catlinks\" class=\"catlinks\" data-mw=\"interface\"><div id=\"mw-normal-catlinks\" class=\"mw-normal-catlinks\"><a href=\"/mediawiki-1.32.1/index.php?title=Special:Categories\" title=\"Special:Categories\">Category</a>: <ul><li><a href=\"/mediawiki-1.32.1/index.php?title=Category:Database_of_herbs_and_minerals\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Category:Database of herbs and minerals\">Database of herbs and minerals</a></li><